# midnight build

a field log from the machine room. everything below ran at 00:47.

## recon

```bash {#recon} {run} {session=ops}
uname -s -r
uptime
```

## checksum sweep

hash every loom doc in this directory, sorted, so we notice drift.

```bash {#sweep} {run} {session=ops}
sha256sum *.loom | sort
```

## prime sieve

when the network is quiet, burn CPU on something honest.

```python {#sieve} {run} {session=py-ops}
def primes(n):
    sieve = [True] * (n + 1)
    return [i for i, p in enumerate(sieve) if p and i > 1
            and not any(i % d == 0 for d in range(2, int(i ** 0.5) + 1))]

print(primes(50))
```

## checklist

- recon clean
- checksums recorded
- sieve nominal
- lights out
